tml":"Ch.VIII §2.4, print552/PDF564; local prefix translations"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>P、Q 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\sqcup Q\">\\(P\\sqcup Q\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6000c17a080be9b6\" href=\"?note=6000c17a080be9b6\" title=\"72-df-proof-system-binary-join\">72-df-proof-system-binary-join</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_p\">\\(\\le_p\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b16c13e741889b14\" href=\"?note=b16c13e741889b14\" title=\"72-df-proof-system-comparison\">72-df-proof-system-comparison</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P\\sqcup Q),\\qquad P\\le_p(P\\sqcup Q),\\qquad Q\\le_p(P\\sqcup Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P\\sqcup Q),\\qquad P\\le_p(P\\sqcup Q),\\qquad Q\\le_p(P\\sqcup Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>读取首位后运行 P 或 Q 的多项式程序，总运行时间仍是多项式。输出总为重言式且 P 分支已满射至全部 TAUT。转换 w↦0w、w↦1w 为线性时间，分别保持结论，故两个 p 模拟成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-system-binary-join","status":"resolved","id":"6000c17a080be9b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-pro